#N canvas 50 50 1100 900 10;
#X text 20 5 Metal - a resonant body after Jaffedrone's (gender \, bonang \, gong \, bowl \, handpan \, steelpan \, glass \, alien: knob 1) \, sung by breath. Soft breath sounds the low modes \; harder breath brings the upper ones in (Bloom: how far). The fundamental beats against its twin (Shimmer). Breath noise rubs it \; Tone brightens it. Knobs: Body \, Bloom \, Shimmer \, Tone;
